  "properties": {
    "title": "A Digital Twin of 80km of streetscapes, with FOSS4G? Sure!",
    "description": "Melbourne\u2019s tram network is considering Mobility Aid Lifts for wheelchair access from street level on selected routes. We scanned and processed 80km or routes with OS only in an ROS sensor framework with cloud-optimised data processing to detect stops and simulate MAL deployments.\n\nA hero story, featuring, COTS sensors, ROS, COPC, machine learning and friends. It can be done!",
